  --- the reading ---
  IT DIES WITH THE DRIVER. The best hold arm is `heard-6` at SNR 2.07, +2.0 SE
  over its silent control -- no alternation survives the caregiver going
  quiet. `framecopy` measured the listening reflex and nothing more.
  SO THE FRAME STILL DOES NOT EXIST, and now it is known that hearing one
  will not install it. The remaining route is an INTERNAL oscillator on the
  voicing gate -- the tau 60 ms path that can carry a syllable rate, and the
  one target no oscillator in this project has ever had.
